PRSL-AI ECOSYSTEM
PRSL-AI Knowledge
Canonical Definition v1.0

Organization: Robert Software Labs
Status: Canonical
Classification: Core Intelligence Infrastructure
Architecture: AI-Agnostic / Local-First / Privacy by Default / Human-Centered

==================================================

1. DEFINITION

PRSL-AI Knowledge is the ecosystem capability responsible for acquiring, organizing, validating, representing, governing, retrieving and providing trusted knowledge to the intelligence layer.

Knowledge exists independently from any specific AI model or provider.

==================================================

2. CORE PRINCIPLE

Knowledge represents what the ecosystem can know and provide as evidence to intelligence.

Knowledge is not:

- Context.
- Memory.
- Intelligence.
- Governance.
- A language model.
- A single database.
- RAG alone.

Canonical distinction:

Knowledge
→ What is known.

Memory
→ What is preserved for continuity.

Context
→ What is relevant now.

Intelligence
→ What is reasoned from available information.

==================================================

3. PURPOSE

PRSL-AI Knowledge exists to:

- Provide reliable knowledge to intelligence.
- Reduce dependence on model-embedded knowledge.
- Maintain knowledge independently from AI providers.
- Preserve provenance.
- Support validation.
- Track freshness.
- Detect conflicting information.
- Enable controlled retrieval.
- Support multiple AI providers.
- Support local-first knowledge access.
- Respect privacy and authorization boundaries.

==================================================

4. WHY KNOWLEDGE IS A SEPARATE LAYER

An AI model may contain knowledge internally, but model knowledge is not equivalent to ecosystem knowledge.

Without a dedicated Knowledge layer:

Model A
→ knows one thing.

Model B
→ knows another.

Local Model
→ knows something else.

This can produce inconsistent intelligence.

With PRSL-AI Knowledge:

PRSL-AI Knowledge
↓
Retrieval
↓
OpenAI / Gemini / Local Model / Other Provider
↓
Reasoning

The intelligence provider may change without destroying the ecosystem's knowledge infrastructure.

==================================================

